Feature: TC_17_STAFF - OpenShift Home Screen Searches and Validations E2E Regression Pack

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Legacy  : "Regression Pack for Openshift Home Screen Cases" (BISSAGL-12980, AT-TC-01 to 13,
  #           tmslinks BISSAGL-18521 / 18524 / 18541 / 18544 / 18546 / 18548 / 18653 / 18655 / 18657 / 18659 / 18661 /
  #           18665 / 18668)
  # Rewritten 16-10-2026 in the StaffSteps vocabulary (the wording the MAPS features run with). One end-to-end
  # scenario on the OpenShift deployment; # SECTION markers show where each legacy scenario starts.
  #
  # Purpose:
  #   Every search on the staff Home screen works and rejects bad input with the right message:
  #     - Applications tab: herd search, invalid herd, empty search, reference search, farmer search
  #     - Parcels tab: valid parcel with its row actions, invalid and empty parcel searches
  #     - Reference No. tab: valid and invalid reference
  #     - Online Response tab: search with no criteria and by herd
  #
  # Legacy coverage notes carried forward:
  #   - AT-TC-09 repeated the AT-TC-08 steps exactly (parcel validations); run once here.
  #   - Legacy only searched in AT-TC-01; Section 1 also opens the application from the result, which proves the
  #     search found it.
  #   - AT-TC-06 (farmer surname "123") had no check in legacy; it runs as the second row of the farmer search.
  #
  # Test data:
  #   Herds, reference numbers and LPIS parcels from the database ("Get Submitted Herds", "Get Reference Numbers",
  #   "Get LPIS Parcels"), as in legacy. Invalid values and the farmer search values are legacy literals.
  #   Login agr4442 (BISS Co-ordination 1). Password: TD:Password from the TestData row of this test case.
  #
  # Step definitions: stepdefinitions.BISS.STAFF.StaffSteps (Home screen, Parcels, Reference No., Online Response)
  # Author: Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Background:
    Given the staff user is logged in to the OpenShift BISS portal as "agr4442"

  @regression @staff @openshift @search @validation @e2e
  Scenario: AT-STAFF-OS-HOME-E2E-01 - Staff runs every Home screen search and its validations on OpenShift

    # SECTION 1 : Herd search - AT-TC-01 (BISSAGL-18521)
    When the staff user searches the Home screen for the next submitted herd for scheme year "2024"
    Then the application should be openable from the search results

    # SECTION 2 : Invalid herd - AT-TC-02 (BISSAGL-18524)
    When the staff user searches the Home screen for herd "ASUDASHADI" for scheme year "2024"
    Then the staff user should see the search error "The herd number you entered is invalid"

    # SECTION 3 : Search with no data - AT-TC-03 (BISSAGL-18541)
    When the staff user searches the Home screen with no criteria
    Then the staff user should see the following search errors
      | The herd number you entered is invalid      |
      | The reference number you entered is invalid |

    # SECTION 4 : Reference number search - AT-TC-04 (BISSAGL-18544)
    When the staff user opens the application for the next reference number for scheme year "2024"

    # SECTION 5 : Farmer search, then farmer search validation - AT-TC-05 (BISSAGL-18546) / AT-TC-06 (BISSAGL-18548)
    When the staff user searches the Home screen for the following farmers
      | surname | county  |
      | mc      | Donegal |
      | 123     | Donegal |

    # SECTION 6 : Valid parcel and its row actions - AT-TC-07 (BISSAGL-18653)
    When the staff user searches the Parcels screen for the next LPIS parcel for scheme year "2024"
    Then the following parcel actions should be available
      | View Claimants |
      | View Commonage |
      | Parcel History |
      | View Map       |

    # SECTION 7 : Parcel number validations - AT-TC-08 (BISSAGL-18655) / AT-TC-09 (BISSAGL-18657)
    When the staff user searches the Parcels screen for invalid parcel "adssdasd" for scheme year "2024"
    And the staff user clears the parcel search
    And the staff user searches the Parcels screen with no parcel number

    # SECTION 8 : Reference No. tab search - AT-TC-10 (BISSAGL-18659)
    When the staff user searches the Reference No. screen for the next reference number for scheme year "2023"

    # SECTION 9 : Reference No. validation - AT-TC-11 (BISSAGL-18661)
    When the staff user searches the Reference No. screen for invalid reference "adssdasd"
    Then the staff user should see the search error "Invalid reference no."

    # SECTION 10 : Online Response with no criteria - AT-TC-12 (BISSAGL-18665)
    When the staff user searches the Online Response screen with no criteria

    # SECTION 11 : Online Response by herd - AT-TC-13 (BISSAGL-18668)
    And the staff user searches the Online Response screen for the next submitted herd
